Origin
------

MuiBuilderQt is a from-scratch Qt6/C++ reimplementation of Eric Totel's
MUI-Builder (v2.3), based on its publicly available SVN source. It is
not a byte-for-byte port. No formal license accompanies the original
MUI-Builder source, and no permission from Eric Totel for this
reimplementation has been confirmed. If you are Eric Totel, or
represent him, please get in touch so this can be resolved properly.

